    <a href="https://brewingagile.org/">Brewing Agile</a>
    <time>conference series</time>
    <p>I founded Brewing Agile in 2012. It grew out of the Scrum Beers crowd into a Göteborg conference about agile thinking, learning, leadership, collaboration, and process — less about selling a method, more about making space for practice and debate.</p>
    <p>I designed it to be accessible and affordable, because Göteborg deserved quality content without people needing a corporate training budget or a trip abroad.</p>
    <p>I was involved from 2012 through 2018. The public archive pages:</p>
