  <li>
    <a href="https://www.meetup.com/scrum-beers-goteborg/">Scrum Beers Göteborg</a>
    <time>meetup</time>
    <p>Scrum Beers is the low-ceremony version of an agile meetup: people in a pub, talking about teams, delivery, collaboration, architecture, leadership, and whatever is currently making work harder than it needs to be.</p>
    <p>The format matters. Beer helps, but the real point is the relaxed room. No conference posture, no consultant stage voice, no grand framework reveal. Just people comparing notes. Sometimes Lean Coffee, sometimes a theme, often the useful side conversations are the whole event.</p>
